    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a deterministic JSON classification API.\nYour only task is to classify the client's message into ONE of these exact values:\n- ready to proceed\n- rejected\n- interested\n- negotiating\nClient message:{{ $json.body.message }}\nDecision Rules (highest priority first):\n1. If the client confirms they want to start, proceed, schedule a meeting, send an invoice, sign a contract, make payment, or move forward → \"ready to proceed\"\n2. If the client discusses price, budget, discount, payment terms, delivery timeline, project scope, revisions, or asks for better terms → \"negotiating\"\n3. If the client refuses, declines, says they are not interested, already hired someone else, or does not want the service → \"rejected\"\n4. Otherwise → \"interested\"\nOutput Requirements:\n- Return ONLY valid JSON.\n- Do NOT explain your reasoning.\n- Do NOT add extra keys.\n- Do NOT wrap the JSON in markdown.\n- The value of \"classification\" MUST be exactly one of:\n  - interested\n  - negotiating\n  - rejected\n  - ready to proceed\nExpected Output:\n{\"classification\": \"<one of the four allowed values>\"\n}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {}
      },
